WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.190
In 1727 a large Ottoman army
besieged Davit Bek

2
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:11.576
in his fortress of Halidzor,
in the gorges of Syunik.

3
00:00:11.616 --> 00:00:14.526
As food ran low,
he led the garrison out

4
00:00:14.566 --> 00:00:18.508
in a sudden sortie,
and the besiegers broke and fled.

5
00:00:18.748 --> 00:00:21.745
His men drove the Ottomans
from Ghapan.

6
00:00:21.985 --> 00:00:25.840
Man the walls,
and charge with Davit Bek.

